Step 3 — Configure firewall rules

Exit router container and run these on the host terminal:

sudo iptables -F

Add rules:

sudo iptables -A FORWARD -i br-288a365a777c -p icmp --icmp-type echo-request -j DROP
sudo iptables -A FORWARD -i br-c39f0aea5210 -p icmp --icmp-type echo-request -j ACCEPT
sudo iptables -A FORWARD -p icmp --icmp-type echo-reply -j ACCEPT
sudo iptables -P FORWARD DROP
